uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format --check .
uv run mypy {{ package_name }} tests
uv run pytest
```

## Layout

- `{{ package_name }}/__init__.py`: the public API, listed in `__all__`.
- `{{ package_name }}/core.py`: the implementation.
- `{{ package_name }}/py.typed`: marks the package as typed for downstream checkers.
- `tests/`: pytest, offline.
- `CHANGELOG.md`: user-visible changes, kept under "Unreleased" until a release.
- `.github/workflows/ci.yml`: the same checks on GitHub Actions.

See `AGENTS.md` for the rules coding agents follow in this project.
